<section class="page-hero"><span class="pub-kicker">How StockChief works</span><h1>One operating loop from signal to verified result.</h1><p>StockChief does not let an AI model rewrite inventory or accounting. Language helps understand intent and documents; deterministic services own business truth and execution.</p></section>
<section class="loop-explainer"><article><span>01</span><div><small>NOTICE</small><h2>Observe the business fact</h2><p>A sale, email, receipt, count, payment, tracking scan or scheduled review changes what the business knows.</p></div><b>Events remain idempotent</b></article><article><span>02</span><div><small>DECIDE</small><h2>Use current operational evidence</h2><p>Available stock, commitments, incoming supply, costs, lead times, customer promises and rules are evaluated together.</p></div><b>Facts before language</b></article><article><span>03</span><div><small>PREPARE</small><h2>Build the exact work</h2><p>A transfer, PO, response, fulfillment, label, payment request or accounting consequence is prepared with its expected impact.</p></div><b>Preview the consequence</b></article><article><span>04</span><div><small>APPROVE OR EXECUTE</small><h2>Respect the authority boundary</h2><p>Routine work inside explicit limits proceeds. Missing facts, unusual risk and out-of-policy consequences go to Needs You.</p></div><b>Separate permissions</b></article><article><span>05</span><div><small>VERIFY</small><h2>Confirm what actually happened</h2><p>Provider results, physical events and internal records are reconciled. A retry cannot quietly produce a second effect.</p></div><b>Zero or one effect</b></article><article><span>06</span><div><small>REPORT</small><h2>Show the connected business story</h2><p>Activity, Needs You, Ask StockChief and reports explain what completed, what remains open and why the decision was made.</p></div><b>Evidence stays linked</b></article></section>
<section class="deterministic-band"><div><span class="pub-kicker pub-kicker--light">Two systems, one responsibility</span><h2>AI understands.<br>Business engines decide and execute.</h2></div><div><article><small>LANGUAGE LAYER</small><p>Questions, documents, emails, names, intent and prepared communication.</p></article><i>→</i><article><small>DETERMINISTIC LAYER</small><p>Inventory, reservations, purchasing, payments, accounting, authority and idempotent actions.</p></article></div></section>
